OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why bond market wildfire
OL,4,Ais keeping world leaders up at night
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not just the wildfire burning in
OL,7,Fthe bond markets, with many countries
OL,8,Ffacing interest rates at multi-decade
OL,9,Fhighs.
OL,11,FThe markets lending money to
OL,12,Fgovernments appear to be changing more
OL,13,Ffundamentally too.
OL,15,FOver summer, the message has been made
OL,16,Fclear: countries will have to pay more
OL,17,Fto borrow cash.
