OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why bond market wildfire
OL,4,Ais keeping world leaders up at night
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe immediate reason is the ongoing
OL,7,Fclosure of the Strait of Hormuz and
OL,8,Frenewed hostilities between the US and
OL,9,FIran, which has pushed up inflation
OL,10,Fand, in turn, raised expectations of
OL,11,Fhigher interest rates in the world's
OL,12,Fmajor economies.
